description=Enables USB debugging, disables the ADB authorization prompt, and starts ADB over TCP 5555 so a PC can connect over WiFi/hotspot with no cable and no touch. Honor 6X / EMUI 8 / Android 8. GitHub: https://github.com/Hrishi2861 | TG: https://t.me/rtx5069
